sequenceDiagram
    actor S as Student
    actor P as Professor
    participant API as Express API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over S,P: Student Requests Enrollment
    S->>API: POST /courses/:id/enroll
    API->>API: authenticate + authorize(student)
    API->>DB: check for existing enrollment
    DB-->>API: null (not enrolled)
    API->>DB: enrollmentRepo.create(studentId, courseId, pending)
    DB-->>API: enrollment record
    API-->>S: 201 Created (status: pending)

    Note over S,P: Professor Reviews
    P->>API: GET /courses/:id/enrollments
    API->>API: authenticate + authorize(professor)
    API->>DB: enrollmentRepo.findByCourse(courseId)
    DB-->>API: list of enrollments
    API-->>P: 200 OK (enrollments list)

    Note over S,P: Professor Approves
    P->>API: PATCH /enrollments/:id/status { status: approved }
    API->>API: authenticate + authorize(professor)
    API->>DB: enrollmentRepo.findById(id)
    DB-->>API: enrollment record
    API->>API: verify professor owns course
    API->>API: verify enrollment status = pending
    API->>DB: enrollmentRepo.updateStatus(id, approved)
    DB-->>API: updated enrollment
    API-->>P: 200 OK

    Note over S,P: Student Accesses Course
    S->>API: GET /courses/:id/materials
    API->>API: authenticate + authorize(student)
    API->>DB: verify enrollment = approved
    DB-->>API: confirmed
    API->>DB: materialRepo.findByCourse(courseId)
    DB-->>API: list of materials
    API-->>S: 200 OK
